OL,3,ABurnham wants Neets report to be
OL,4,Awatershed moment, No 10 says, as Tories
OL,5,Acriticise welfare and tax proposals
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the Commons, the Conservatives say
OL,8,Fthe "lion's share" of what's
OL,9,Frecommended is a "massive spending
OL,10,Fplan"
OL,12,FFfion, 24, tells us she is "losing
OL,13,Fhope" after applying for 100 jobs since
OL,14,FJune and getting just three interviews,
OL,15,Fwhile Ewan, 22, encourages people to
OL,16,Fapply for apprenticeships
OL,18,FIn Bournemouth, cafe owner Ben worries
OL,19,Fabout the costs of taking on young
OL,20,Fpeople: "Our margins have been squeezed
OL,21,Fand squeezed and squeezed"
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
