OL,3,AHenry Nowak killer applies to appeal
OL,4,Aagainst conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man jailed for murdering Henry
OL,7,FNowak has applied to appeal against his
OL,8,Fconviction.
OL,10,FVickrum Digwa, who stabbed the
OL,11,F18-year-old student with a large dagger
OL,12,Fin Belmont Road, Southampton, on 3
OL,13,FDecember 2025, has also asked the
OL,14,FSupreme Court to review his sentence,
OL,15,Fhis lawyers have confirmed.
OL,17,FEarlier this month the Court of Appeal
OL,18,Fraised his minimum term from 21 to 25
OL,19,Fyears, after the Attorney General
OL,20,Fargued it was unduly lenient.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
