OL,3,AJensen Huang pushes Nvidia comeback
OL,4,Aafter board rejects pressure to
OL,5,Areinstate ex-boss
OL,6,
OL,7,FJensen Huang said he would be
OL,8,F"honoured" to return as the boss of
OL,9,Ftech giant Nvidia, in his first public
OL,10,Fcomments since his shock resignation.
OL,12,F"I created problems for the Board that
OL,13,FI deeply regret. I own my mistakes
OL,14,Fcompletely," Huang said on X, days
OL,15,Fafter reports he had extramarital
OL,16,Faffairs, including with an alleged
OL,17,FChinese spy.
OL,19,FBut he said he had an "outpouring" of
OL,20,Fcalls from company employees, investors
OL,21,Fand others calling for him to return as
OL,22,FCEO of Nvidia.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
